      "cr": 2,
      "type": {
        "value": "humanoid"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>THORD — level 3 PC pregen, Dhul Maldur dwarf dissident, \"the turncoat\". Knows the mine in his bones.</p><p><strong>Manual riders:</strong> Dwarven resilience — advantage on saves vs. poison (resist poison damage is on the sheet). Stonecunning — knows tunnel layout, finds hidden seams/levers, never lost underground (Perception/Survival proficient). Drop the Prop: the 10-ft spill becomes difficult terrain (mark on scene); can seal a small passage instead.</p>"
      }
    },
    "skills": {
      "prc": {
        "value": 1,
        "ability": "wis"
      },
      "sur": {
        "value": 1,
        "ability": "wis"
      }
    }
  },
  "items": [
    {
      "name": "Drop the Prop",
      "img": "icons/environment/settlement/mine-cart-rocks-red.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "_id": "KGKyuWQWMgkWyI4o",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>He knows every weak support. Collapse a pillar, beam or cart within 20 ft: creatures in the spill (target up to 2) make a <strong>DC 13 Dexterity save</strong> or take <strong>2d6 bludgeoning</strong> and are <strong>knocked prone</strong> (nothing on a success). <strong>1/day</strong>.</p><p><em>Manual riders: the 10-ft area becomes difficult terrain (mark it on the scene); can instead seal a small passage — narrate it.</em></p>",
          "chat": ""
